        'etc/xdg/uwsm/env.d/61-devario-virtio.sh')
# Adopt the exact unowned files left by older ISOs, preserving their contents.
# Missing paths install normally; later package-owned upgrades use normal policy.
# Keep this inventory aligned with files.tsv. Requires Shelly's RLPM backend.
